### ====================================================================
### SERVERCLOUD REST API - TESTING SUITE
### Base URL: http://localhost:5000
### ====================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000
@adminToken = 
@clientToken = 

### 1. Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/

### --------------------------------------------------------------------
### AUTHENTICATION & USERS
### --------------------------------------------------------------------

### 2. Login sebagai Admin
# @name adminLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@servercloud.id",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Ambil token admin dari response di atas lalu set ke variable
@adminToken = {{adminLogin.response.body.data.token}}

### 3. Login sebagai Client
# @name clientLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "client@servercloud.id",
  "password": "password123"
}

### Ambil token client dari response di atas lalu set ke variable
@clientToken = {{clientLogin.response.body.data.token}}

### 4. Register Pengguna Baru (Client)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "full_name": "Budi Santoso",
  "email": "budi@example.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "phone": "081299887766"
}

### 5. Cek Validasi Zod (Email tidak valid & password kurang dari 6 digit)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "full_name": "X",
  "email": "email_salah",
  "password": "123"
}

### 6. Get Profile User Aktif (Admin)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### --------------------------------------------------------------------
### KATEGORI LAYANAN
### --------------------------------------------------------------------

### 7. Ambil Semua Kategori Layanan
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/categories

### 8. Ambil Detail Kategori Berdasarkan ID (Beserta Paketnya)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/categories/1

### 9. Tambah Kategori Baru (Admin Only)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Kubernetes Managed Cluster",
  "description": "Layanan orkestrasi container otomatis dengan high-availability untuk arsitektur microservices."
}

### 10. Uji Otorisasi: Client mencoba Tambah Kategori (Ekspektasi: 403 Forbidden)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{clientToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Kategori Terlarang",
  "description": "Tidak boleh dibuat oleh client biasa"
}

### 11. Update Kategori (Admin Only)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/categories/1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Cloud VPS NVMe Ultra",
  "description": "Server virtual performa ekstrem dengan NVMe SSD Gen 4."
}

### --------------------------------------------------------------------
### PAKET LAYANAN CLOUD / SERVER
### --------------------------------------------------------------------

### 12. Ambil Semua Paket Server
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/packages

### 13. Filter Paket Berdasarkan Kategori (contoh: category_id=1)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/packages?category_id=1

### 14. Pencarian Paket Server (contoh: search=starter)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/packages?search=starter

### 15. Urutkan Paket Berdasarkan Harga Termurah (sort=price_asc)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/packages?sort=price_asc

### 16. Ambil Detail Paket Server Berdasarkan ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/packages/1

### 17. Tambah Paket Server Baru (Admin Only - JSON body)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/packages
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "category_id": 1,
  "name": "VPS Developer Micro 2G",
  "cpu_cores": 2,
  "ram_gb": 2,
  "storage_gb": 40,
  "bandwidth_tb": 2,
  "price_per_month": 120000,
  "stock_available": 10,
  "description": "Paket hemat khusus siswa dan mahasiswa untuk hosting tugas dan project latihan.",
  "image_url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1558494949-ef010cbdcc31?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80"
}

### 18. Uji Validasi Zod Paket Server (Ekspektasi: 400 Bad Request jika cpu/ram minus)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/packages
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "category_id": 1,
  "name": "VP",
  "cpu_cores": 0,
  "ram_gb": -2,
  "storage_gb": -50,
  "bandwidth_tb": 0,
  "price_per_month": -1000
}

### 19. Update Paket Server (Admin Only)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/packages/1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "category_id": 1,
  "name": "VPS Starter NVMe 1G (Promo)",
  "cpu_cores": 1,
  "ram_gb": 1,
  "storage_gb": 30,
  "bandwidth_tb": 2,
  "price_per_month": 75000,
  "stock_available": 25,
  "description": "Promo diskon akhir semester untuk pelajar dan UMKM.",
  "image_url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1558494949-ef010cbdcc31?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80"
}

### 20. Hapus Paket Server (Admin Only)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/packages/4
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
